<section class="page-hero"><div class="ph-media"><img class="zoom" src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calc.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calc-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calc.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="660" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="shell ph-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><span aria-current="page">Claim tools</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Tennessee Insurance Claim Tools</h1><p class="lede">7 calculators and planners built from real appraisal work. Check the carrier’s math, plan deadlines and decide next steps. No sign-up, nothing stored.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="shell"><div class="tool-grid" data-stagger><a class="tool-card rv" href="/tennessee-claim-tools/claim-gap-calculator/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>Δ</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</h2><span>Measure the dispute, test where an award could land and subtract appraiser and umpire fees to see your net.</span></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/tennessee-claim-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="960" height="631" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>ACV</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><span>List damaged items by age and life to estimate your first check, the depreciation held back and the full payout.</span></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/tennessee-claim-tools/roof-area-pitch-calculator/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>▲</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Roof Area &amp; Pitch Calculator</h2><span>Turn a footprint into true roof squares using pitch, overhang and waste, then compare with the estimate.</span></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/tennessee-claim-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>%</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Percentage Deductible Calculator</h2><span>See a wind/hail or earthquake percentage deductible in dollars and what a claim would actually pay.</span></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/tennessee-claim-tools/claim-deadline-calendar/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>◷</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Planner</small><h2>Claim Deadline Calendar</h2><span>Map notice, proof-of-loss, holdback and suit-limitation dates from your date of loss, then export to a calendar.</span></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/tennessee-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-check/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/inspection.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/inspection-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/inspection.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="765" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>✓</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Checklist</small><h2>Appraisal Readiness Check</h2><span>Twelve yes/no questions that score your claim file and build a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</span></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/tennessee-claim-tools/tree-debris-allowance-calculator/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>♣</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Tree &amp; Debris Allowance Calculator</h2><span>New for Tennessee storms: see how tree-removal limits and debris coverage apply to where the tree landed.</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec mist"><div class="shell split top"><div class="rv-l"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the tools together</h2><ol class="numbered"><li>Start with the <a href="/tennessee-claim-tools/claim-deadline-calendar/">deadline calendar</a> so nothing lapses.</li><li>Check roof math with the <a href="/tennessee-claim-tools/roof-area-pitch-calculator/">roof area &amp; pitch calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’ll actually receive with the <a href="/tennessee-claim-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/">deductible</a> and <a href="/tennessee-claim-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">holdback</a> calculators.</li><li>After a tree comes down, run the <a href="/tennessee-claim-tools/tree-debris-allowance-calculator/">tree &amp; debris allowance calculator</a>.</li><li>Test the dispute with the <a href="/tennessee-claim-tools/claim-gap-calculator/">claim gap estimator</a>, then take the <a href="/tennessee-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-check/">readiness check</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv-r"><div class="box call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk to an appraiser</h2><p>The first conversation is free. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="big-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn red" href="/get-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
</main>
